## Where it fits in the sequence

**Before.** Health authorities and civil protection agencies can hold units in storage and train their own teams to open them. Preparedness here means the unit is already in the country, already assigned, and the people who will use it have handled it once.

**During.** When a hospital is under pressure, units extend it: a triage area in the parking lot, an isolation ward, a vaccination point, a place for staff to rest between shifts.

## What the Foundation does

CMAX Foundation does not sell units. It identifies institutions with a documented need, raises the support to place a unit there, coordinates delivery with Cmax System and partners, and publishes the result.

## Documentation

Field deployments carried out by the Foundation will be recorded under [Our Actions](/our-actions), with location, date, recipient and photographs.
